==German==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|müle|mül(e)}}, {{m|gmh|müline|mülīn(e)}}, from {{inh|de|goh|mulī}}, {{m|goh|mulīn}}, from {{der|de|la|molīna}}, {{m|la|molīnum}}. Cognate with {{cog|nl|molen}}, {{cog|en|mill}}, and further with {{cog|fr|moulin}}, {{cog|es|molino}}.

